lists PashhowMarshlands/Suspicious_Hume/onTrigger PashhowMarshlands/onEventFinish/40 PortBastok/Suspicious_Galka/onTrigger PortBastok/Suspicious_Galka/onTrade PortBastok/onEventFinish/419 PortWindurst/Suspicious_Tarutaru/onTrigger PortWindurst/Suspicious_Tarutaru/onTrade PortWindurst/onEventFinish/881 Feretory/onZoneIn/1 Feretory/onEventUpdate/2 Feretory/onEventFinish/2
